<http://data.silknow.org/object/14e9ea20-9ea3-364f-aaf5-470bd9216392>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of brocaded silk and metal threads, plain weave ground.\nWarp: dark blue silk indeterminable twist.\nWeft: pink silk S-twist.\nMetal thread: silver-gilt strip close S-wound on a yellow silk core, Z-twist.\nDark blue ground with a boteh pattern: two complete right-facing botehs with partial left-facing ones above and below in offset rows. The floral elements in each boteh are in metal thread outlined in pink. The two side edges have been turned under."@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk and metal threads, Iran, 1800-1899"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c65cc1c2-e87a-3348-8cd5-5cad8ebeefa5> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c33d05dd-29e0-31f2-b489-210d000c8cc0> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of brocaded silk and metal threads, plain weave ground.\nWarp: dark blue silk indeterminable twist.\nWeft: pink silk S-twist.\nMetal thread: silver-gilt strip close S-wound on a yellow silk core, Z-twist.\nDark blue ground with a boteh pattern: two complete right-facing botehs with partial left-facing ones above and below in offset rows. The floral elements in each boteh are in metal thread outlined in pink. The two side edges have been turned under."@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk and metal threads, Iran, 1800-1899"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/14e9ea20-9ea3-364f-aaf5-470bd9216392/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/14e9ea20-9ea3-364f-aaf5-470bd9216392/dimension/1> ;
